-2.589320                alpha0      ! 0-lift angle of attack, depends on airfoil.
13.843568                alpha1      ! Angle of attack at f=0.7, (approximately the stall angle) for AOA>alpha0. (deg)
-10.682257               alpha2      ! Angle of attack at f=0.7, (approximately the stall angle) for AOA<alpha0. (deg)
